<span style="color:Azure"><big><strong>--Carter's Living Room--</strong></big></span><br>

You stand in <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s bathroom. Your friend sits outside in the living room. The bathroom is blue in color, with a large bath-shower combo. Despite being used by multiple boys of various ages, it seems pretty well cleaned.<br>
<br>

